      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "everything above is ONE of 8 parallel jobs. The\nsplit is OUR engineering, purely for speed (38\nh serial → ~13 h). Graphiti is unaware of it.",
